    "HomeChains retains Type transitions even where offersTyping is false; flagged paths through unavailable Type are overapproximations.",
    "Starter counts8/8/6/6 and Emergency6 trim tile controls in every reached state. Targets retain full layout frames if any part is visible; source tile look areas are clipped to viewport/window at scroll offset0.",
